://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025120/extras/2b6774e7b17a290be34b2fa4328e0101.poster.avif?t=1758455521\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025120/extras/2b6774e7b17a290be34b2fa4328e0101.webm?t=1758455521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025120/extras/2b6774e7b17a290be34b2fa4328e0101.mp4?t=1758455521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This demo is a <strong>standalone 1 km\u00b2 map</strong>, created to give a small taste of our upcoming cinematic open-world adventure. The full game will feature a <strong>handcrafted 64 km\u00b2 world</strong>, with every system and detail built far beyond what\u2019s shown here \u2014 in other words, this is only about <strong>1% of the journey in scale and features</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the pillars of a complete experience \u2014 <strong>combat, crafting, inventory, shop, progression, and more</strong> \u2014 are in <strong>active, advanced development</strong>. What you see here is simply a preview of the atmosphere, exploration, and foundation we\u2019re building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for trying it out and sharing feedback \u2014 every bit helps us shape the final adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025120?t=1758455521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025120/0bb00fd9b2cb5510cf0ce0f99d6330d45d962506/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758455521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025120/6c554edaed6b60dc3543f396f597e01fc16692c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758455521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025120/6c554edaed6b60dc3543f396f597e01fc16692c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758455521","categories":[{"description":"Single-